```console
$ scherzo-cloud run input-set delete --help
Delete a Run Input Set and schedule content cleanup

Usage: scherzo-cloud run input-set delete [OPTIONS] --yes <ORGANIZATION> <INPUT_SET>

Arguments:
  <ORGANIZATION>  Organization ID or exact slug
  <INPUT_SET>     Run Input Set ID

Options:
      --yes                            Confirm this action
      --json                           Print the run result as JSON
      --service-api-key-file <PATH|->  Authenticate with a service API key from a private file, or - for standard input
      --allow-insecure-http            Allow this command's Scherzo Cloud requests over insecure HTTP connections
  -h, --help                           Print help

Deletion:
  The Run Input Set becomes logically unavailable; content cleanup is scheduled.

```
